Crindle Vilksnake is an operative of the [[Org/Actinium Convox/index|Actinium Convox]]. He is black-furred, with silver streaks running back from his eyes, and goes about brooding under a pulled-up hood. He works spellcraft, and he trusts stealth and a direct strike over a stand-up fight.
